# Reviewers requested automatically when a pull request opens.
#
# A catch-all, so nothing in the repository can be changed without a review
# being asked for. `EdgeFirstAI/.github` omits its catch-all deliberately —
# GitHub treats that repository's community health files as org-wide defaults
# — but this is an ordinary repository, so the catch-all is the point.
#
# Requesting a review is not requiring one: that comes from the `main` ruleset.
# This file decides WHO is asked; the ruleset decides whether the answer is
# needed before merge.
#
# Later matching patterns override earlier ones, so add path-specific entries below
# the catch-all to route each area to its owner.
